{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Climb to the top!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275480/extras/9b862b5061b3119e902cf1acc8ed3033.poster.avif?t=1746467243\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275480/extras/9b862b5061b3119e902cf1acc8ed3033.webm?t=1746467243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275480/extras/9b862b5061b3119e902cf1acc8ed3033.mp4?t=1746467243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Green Heights is a first person vertical precision platformer with smooth and satisfying movement. Set in a unique terrarium like environment climb the tower and reach the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get back on your feet<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275480/extras/2c47085a299a62936b0871c2eb77cc86.poster.avif?t=1746467243\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275480/extras/2c47085a299a62936b0871c2eb77cc86.webm?t=1746467243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275480/extras/2c47085a299a62936b0871c2eb77cc86.mp4?t=1746467243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Falling down is inevitable, every mistake is a lesson learned that you can use to climb even faster. Lots of shortcut are available in the tower, discover them to beat your personal best!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275480/extras/9d8eb4439dedb913cd3f00351e487c28.poster.avif?t=1746467243\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275480/extras/9d8eb4439dedb913cd3f00351e487c28.webm?t=1746467243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275480/extras/9d8eb4439dedb913cd3f00351e487c28.mp4?t=1746467243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fluid and responsive movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric terrarium vegetation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, Jumps, climb and bounce your way to the top</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover shortcut</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personal best time Ghost racing</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Reach the top","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3275480/f7910488889623ac2c9b3b0e4a0d0a44fcc16555.jpg"},{"name":"Coyote Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3275480/ebd03400958334c41ab0c5a9281e5a8d708b7bb5.jpg"},{"name":"Loving Family","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3275480/6ebd51ed962b4c1d8c4ea94c244dd9728ffbbc23.jpg"},{"name":"100m Check Point","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3275480/b46ffdffd7e44bcdebf35b5d50f50ec3232e401b.jpg"},{"name":"200m Check Point","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3275480/7fc2770284524458228dfce93c1cff6ca848ab2a.jpg"},{"name":"300m Check Point","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3275480/4a01473ee1ca8569eef7ab15f381788a3d1aa992.jpg"},{"name":"Sub 30","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/pub